To test only part

, Create a test file
Create lib/test_screen.dart:
import 'package:flutter/material.dart';
import 'screens/treasure_chest_page.dart';

void main() {
  runApp(MaterialApp(
    home: TreasureChestPage(),  // Test just this screen
  ));
}
Then run: flutter run -t lib/test_screen.dart

Option 3: Use Flutter DevTools
While your app is running:

Option 4: Write actual unit/widget tests
Create test/bow_animation_test.dart:
dartimport 'package:flutter_test/flutter_test.dart';
import 'package:your_app_name/widgets/bow_animation.dart';

void main() {
  testWidgets('Bow animation renders', (WidgetTester tester) async {
    await tester.pumpWidget(MaterialApp(
      home: Scaffold(body: BowAnimation()),
    ));
    
    expect(find.byType(BowAnimation), findsOneWidget);
  });
}
Run tests with: flutter test


